# Agentic Schematics Marketplace — `marketplace.json` Schema
#
# This file documents the format of `marketplace.json`, which lists
# all schematics in this repository for discovery by AI coding agents.
# The format follows the Claude Code marketplace plugin discovery spec.

## File Extension
`.json` — standard JSON, stored at `<repo-root>/.agent-schematics/marketplace.json`.

## Structure

```jsonc
{
  "$schema": "https://anthropic.com/claude-code/marketplace.schema.json",
  "name": "cameri-schematics",             // Marketplace identifier
  "description": "Agentic schematics —...",  // One-line description
  "owner": {
    "name": "Ricardo Arturo Cabral Mejía",  // Author name
    "url": "https://example.com"            // Optional URL
  },
  "plugins": [                               // List of schematic entries
    {
      "name": "opa-docker-authz",            // Schematic directory name
      "description": "Grants a...",          // From SCHEMATIC.md frontmatter
      "source": "./opa-docker-authz",        // Relative path to schematic dir
      "spec": "SCHEMATIC.md",                // Optional: copyable spec file (default SCHEMATIC.md)
      "category": "infrastructure",          // Classification tag
      "author": {
        "name": "Ricardo Arturo Cabral Mejía",
        "url": "https://agenticschemas.ai"
      },
      "keywords": ["docker", "opa", "tls"]  // Search keywords
    }
  ]
}
```

## Fields

| Field | Required | Type | Description |
|-------|----------|------|-------------|
| `$schema` | yes | string | Validation schema URL |
| `name` | yes | string | Marketplace identifier (`cameri-schematics`) |
| `description` | yes | string | Brief description of the repo |
| `owner.name` | yes | string | Author's full name |
| `owner.email` | no | string | Contact email |
| `owner.url` | no | string | Author website |
| `plugins[].name` | yes | string | Schematic name (matches directory) |
| `plugins[].description` | yes | string | From SCHEMATIC.md `description:` frontmatter |
| `plugins[].source` | yes | string | Relative path to schematic directory |
| `plugins[].spec` | no | string | File the site's "Copy as Markdown" button fetches, relative to `source`. Default: `SCHEMATIC.md`. Use for plugins whose copyable artifact lives elsewhere (e.g. `skills/create-schematic/SKILL.md`). |
| `plugins[].category` | yes | string | `infrastructure`, `authoring`, `engineering`, `devops`, etc. |
| `plugins[].keywords` | no | string[] | Search keywords |
| `plugins[].author.name` | no | string | Per-schematic author override |
| `plugins[].author.email` | no | string | Per-schematic author email |
| `plugins[].author.url` | no | string | Per-schematic author URL |

## Adding a New Schematic

1. Create `<name>/SCHEMATIC.md` with `description:` in frontmatter.
2. Add an entry to `plugins[]` in marketplace.json.
3. Commit and push.

## See Also

- `SCHEMATIC.md` — the full schematic document for a single capability
- `.agent-schematics/marketplace.json` — the actual file
